{"id":"n992cbb89d2","headline":"US-Iran war fuels record oil profits as consumers struggle with soaring costs","summary":"Major oil companies are reporting some of the richest quarterly profits in their history, while consumers face soaring costs. The report links the earnings to the US-Iran war.","why":"Integrated oil majors such as ExxonMobil and Shell produce and refine crude and sell fuel globally, so their earnings track energy prices closely. Record profits signal strong pricing conditions in the oil market.","category":"companies","event_type":"earnings","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Houston","country":"United States of America","lat":29.76,"lon":-95.37,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"@theweek","url":"https://www.theweek.in/news/middle-east/2026/08/01/us-iran-war-fuels-record-oil-profits-as-consumers-struggle-with-soaring-costs.html"},"sources":[{"name":"@theweek","url":"https://www.theweek.in/news/middle-east/2026/08/01/us-iran-war-fuels-record-oil-profits-as-consumers-struggle-with-soaring-costs.html"}],"published_at":"2026-08-01T06:47:53Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"c07d283fb5c75318","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-01T06:47:53Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-01T09:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"SA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-109025.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"jpenrose","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/refinery-oil-aerial-natural-gas-109025/"}}